# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Format: <from> <to> <status>
#
# Short, shareable booking link: bennisoncpa.com/schedule
# Microsoft Bookings gives no way to shorten its own URL, so this stands in for
# it on email signatures, business cards, and anywhere the link gets said aloud.
#
# 302 and not 301 on purpose: browsers cache a 301 hard, so if the booking tool
# or the service alias ever changes, anyone holding a cached 301 lands somewhere
# dead and there is no way to fix it on their machine. A 302 stays steerable.
/schedule   https://bookings.cloud.microsoft/book/BennisonCPA@bennisoncpa.com/   302
/schedule/  https://bookings.cloud.microsoft/book/BennisonCPA@bennisoncpa.com/   302
/book       https://bookings.cloud.microsoft/book/BennisonCPA@bennisoncpa.com/   302
